"Configures the source of the authentication credentials. This is typically the database where the credentials have been created. The value defaults to the database specified in the path portion of the connection string or in the 'database' configuration property. If the database is specified in neither place, the default value is `admin`. This option is only respected when using the MONGO-CR mechanism (the default).\n"
